 incised, regular letters with a reasonably wide module. Alpha has straight bar; kappa has full length arms, rho has a large rounded eye; omicron is full size.",[54,63],{"type":55,"l":56,"from":57,"to":58,"h":59,"unit":60,"atLeast":61,"atMost":62},"letterHeight","Line 1-2","line1","line2","98-100","mm","98","100",{"type":64,"l":65,"from":57,"to":58,"unit":60},"interlinear","Interlineation line 1 to 2",{"_":67,"notBefore":68,"notAfter":69,"evidence":70},"The editors adopt a cautious reading, given the plain form of the letters and the limited extent of the text, suggesting C3 BCE - C1 CE, but with a preference for C2-1 BCE.",-300,100,"lettering",[72,77],{"_":73,"type":74,"ref":75,"region":76},"Segesta","ancient","https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/462487","Sicilia",{"_":73,"type":78,"ref":79,"region":76},"modern","http://sws.geonames.org/2523171",[81],[82,83],37.94171,12.83649,[85,86],37.939381,12.842901,"Sicily",{"_":89,"role":90,"ref":91},"Parco archeologico di Segesta","site","http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/museum/196",[93,96],{"_":94,"type":95},"16987","inventory",{"_":97,"type":95},"17031",{"_":99,"mainLang":100,"languages":101},"Ancient Greek","grc",[99],"",{"n":104,"url":105,"height":106,"width":107,"desc":108,"surfaceType":109},"screen","ISic001699_tiled.tif","3680px","5520px","I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana","front",[111],{"atLeast":112,"atMost":69},98,[114],"Ampolo, 2021, Segesta. Supplemento epigrafico 2021",[116],"LCEMRFE2",[118,119,120,26,29,33,121,121,122,123,121,124,125,100],"isic001699","i.sicily inscription 001699",{"_":12},"segesta","sicilia","sicily","parco archeologico di segesta","ancient greek","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"ga